    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>培养推荐</>\n1.根据非凡者选取的<Highlight>目标场景</>、非凡者<Highlight>当前属性</>和<Highlight>对抗目标的属性</>，自动为非凡者推荐养成<Highlight>期望收益</>较大的属性；\n2.仅计算常见的<Highlight>养成属性</>，部分未显示属性（如攻击速度增幅、获得护盾增幅）不纳入计算范围；\n3.<Highlight>期望收益</>同时受到该属性在<Highlight>目标场景</>的<Highlight>能力提升幅度</>和<Highlight>养成难度</>的影响；\n4.<Highlight>期望收益</>仅考虑当前属性少量增加的情况，部分属性大量提升后（或与对抗目标的对抗属性相差较大时）的收益会<Highlight>显著增加</>或<Highlight>显著减少</>，推荐仅供参考。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Cultivation Recommendation </>\n 1. Based on the <Highlight>Target Scenario</> selected by the Beyonder, the Beyonder's <Highlight>Current Attributes</>, and the <Highlight>Attributes of the Opponent Target</>, automatically recommend attributes with higher <Highlight>Expected Returns</> for the Beyonder's cultivation; \n 2. Only common <Highlight>Cultivation Attributes</> are calculated; some unshown attributes (such as Attack Speed Boost, Shield Gain Boost) are not included in the calculation range; \n 3. <Highlight>Expected Returns</> are simultaneously influenced by the <Highlight>Ability Improvement Magnitude</> of the attribute in the <Highlight>Target Scenario</> and the <Highlight>Cultivation Difficulty</>; \n 4. <Highlight>Expected Returns</> only consider the situation of a small increase in current attributes. After a large increase in some attributes (or when there is a large difference compared to the opponent's confrontation attributes), the returns will <Highlight>Significantly Increase</> or <Highlight>Significantly Decrease</>. The recommendation is for reference only.",
